# What Vercel leaves behind when it publishes the site.
#
# Vercel keeps a full copy of everything published, for every publish, and counts it against the
# free plan's storage. The live invitation only uses about 6 MB of assets/; the rest (about 95 MB
# of original artwork and earlier designs) stays in git for the record but is not published.
#
# Listed here = not on the live site. Before using one of these files on the page, take its line
# out. server/guests/tests.py checks that nothing the page uses is listed.

# Design notes and tool folders: never part of the site
/.impeccable/
/.claude/
/DESIGN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/VIDEO-REVIEW.md

